{
    "chapter_num": 40,
    "verses_count": 49,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A New City, a New Temple"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the twenty-fifth year of our captivity, at the beginning of the year, on the tenth "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the month, in the fourteenth year after the city was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. struck"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "captured, on the very same day the hand of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " was upon me; and He took me there. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the visions of God He took me into the land of Israel and set me on a very high mountain; on it toward the south "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " something like the structure of a city. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He took me there, and behold, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a man whose appearance "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " like the appearance of bronze. He had a line of flax and a measuring rod in his hand, and he stood in the gateway."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the man said to me, “Son of man, look with your eyes and hear with your ears, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. set your heart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fix your mind on everything I show you; for you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brought here so that I might show "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to you. Declare to the house of Israel everything you see.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now there was a wall all around the outside of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "temple. In the man’s hand was a measuring rod six "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "A royal cubit of about 21 inches"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "cubits "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "long, each being a"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " cubit and a handbreadth; and he measured the width of the wall structure, one rod; and the height, one rod."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Eastern Gateway of the Temple"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he went to the gateway which faced east; and he went up its stairs and measured the threshold of the gateway, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "which was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " one rod wide, and the other threshold "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " one rod wide. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Each gate chamber "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " one rod long and one rod wide; between the gate chambers "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was a space of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " five cubits; and the threshold of the gateway by the vestibule of the inside gate "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " one rod. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He also measured the vestibule of the inside gate, one rod. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he measured the vestibule of the gateway, eight cubits; and the gateposts, two cubits. The vestibule of the gate "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the inside. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the eastern gateway "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " three gate chambers on one side and three on the other; the three "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all the same size; also the gateposts were of the same size on this side and that side."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He measured the width of the entrance to the gateway, ten cubits; "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the length of the gate, thirteen cubits. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. border"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "space in front of the gate chambers, one cubit "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "on this side"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and one cubit on that side; the gate chambers "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " six cubits on this side and six cubits on that side. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he measured the gateway from the roof of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " gate chamber to the roof of the other; the width "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " twenty-five cubits, as door faces door. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He measured the gateposts, sixty cubits high, and the court all around the gateway "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "extended"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the gatepost. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "From"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the front of the entrance gate to the front of the vestibule of the inner gate "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fifty cubits. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " beveled window "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "frames"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the gate chambers and in their intervening archways on the inside of the gateway all around, and likewise in the vestibules. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " windows all around on the inside. And on each gatepost "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " palm trees."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Outer Court"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he brought me into the outer court; and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " chambers and a pavement made all around the court; thirty chambers faced the pavement. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The pavement was by the side of the gateways, corresponding to the length of the gateways; "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the lower pavement. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he measured the width from the front of the lower gateway to the front of the inner court exterior, one hundred cubits toward the east and the north."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Northern Gateway"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "On the outer court was also a gateway facing north, and he measured its length and its width. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Its gate chambers, three on this side and three on that side, its gateposts and its archways, had the same measurements as the first gate; its length "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fifty cubits and its width twenty-five cubits. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Its windows and those of its archways, and also its palm trees, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "had"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the same measurements as the gateway facing east; it was ascended by seven steps, and its archway "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in front of it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "A gate of the inner court was opposite the northern gateway, just as the eastern "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "gateway;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and he measured from gateway to gateway, one hundred cubits."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Southern Gateway"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After that he brought me toward the south, and there a gateway was facing south; and he measured its gateposts and archways according to these same measurements. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " windows in it and in its archways all around like those windows; its length "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fifty cubits and its width twenty-five cubits. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Seven steps led up to it, and its archway "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in front of them; and it had palm trees on its gateposts, one on this side and one on that side. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " also a gateway on the inner court, facing south; and he measured from gateway to gateway toward the south, one hundred cubits."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Gateways of the Inner Court"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he brought me to the inner court through the southern gateway; he measured the southern gateway according to these same measurements. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also its gate chambers, its gateposts, and its archways "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " according to these same measurements; "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " windows in it and in its archways all around; "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fifty cubits long and twenty-five cubits wide. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " archways all around, twenty-five cubits long and five cubits wide. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Its archways faced the outer court, palm trees "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on its gateposts, and going up to it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " eight steps."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he brought me into the inner court facing east; he measured the gateway according to these same measurements. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also its gate chambers, its gateposts, and its archways "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " according to these same measurements; and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " windows in it and in its archways all around; "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fifty cubits long and twenty-five cubits wide. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Its archways faced the outer court, and palm trees "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on its gateposts on this side and on that side; and going up to it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " eight steps."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he brought me to the north gateway and measured "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " according to these same measurements— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "also its gate chambers, its gateposts, and its archways. It had windows all around; its length "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fifty cubits and its width twenty-five cubits. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Its gateposts faced the outer court, palm trees "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on its gateposts on this side and on that side, and going up to it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " eight steps."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Where Sacrifices Were Prepared"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a chamber and its entrance by the gateposts of the gateway, where they washed the burnt offering. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the vestibule of the gateway "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " two tables on this side and two tables on that side, on which to slay the burnt offering, the sin offering, and the trespass offering. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "At the outer side of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "vestibule"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", as one goes up to the entrance of the northern gateway, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " two tables; and on the other side of the vestibule of the gateway "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " two tables. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Four tables "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on this side and four tables on that side, by the side of the gateway, eight tables on which they slaughtered "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the sacrifices."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " also four tables of hewn stone for the burnt offering, one cubit and a half long, one cubit and a half wide, and one cubit high; on these they laid the instruments with which they slaughtered the burnt offering and the sacrifice. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Inside "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " hooks, a handbreadth wide, fastened all around; and the flesh of the sacrifices "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the tables."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Chambers for Singers and Priests"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 44,
                    "num_str": "44",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Outside the inner gate "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the chambers for the singers in the inner court, one facing south at the side of the northern gateway, and the other facing north at the side of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with LXX; MT, Vg. eastern"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "southern gateway. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 45,
                    "num_str": "45",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he said to me, “This chamber which faces south "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for the priests who have charge of the temple. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 46,
                    "num_str": "46",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The chamber which faces north "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for the priests who have charge of the altar; these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sons of Zadok, from the sons of Levi, who come near the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to minister to Him.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Dimensions of the Inner Court and Vestibule"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 47,
                    "num_str": "47",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he measured the court, one hundred cubits long and one hundred cubits wide, foursquare. The altar "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in front of the temple. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 48,
                    "num_str": "48",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he brought me to the vestibule of the temple and measured the doorposts of the vestibule, five cubits on this side and five cubits on that side; and the width of the gateway was three cubits on this side and three cubits on that side. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 49,
                    "num_str": "49",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The length of the vestibule "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " twenty cubits, and the width eleven cubits; and by the steps which led up to it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " pillars by the doorposts, one on this side and another on that side."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}